OL,3,GNEWSAHow Harvey Nichols shaped
OL,4,Anoughties Leeds shopping - and what
OL,5,Acomes next
OL,6,
OL,7,F1996 was the year the Spice Girls ruled
OL,8,Fthe charts, Gazza was scoring for
OL,9,FEngland - and Harvey Nichols opened its
OL,10,Fdoors in Leeds.
OL,12,FThe department store coming to
OL,13,FYorkshire was a big deal. It was the
OL,14,Fbrand's very first foray outside
OL,15,FLondon, and signalled a confidence in
OL,16,Fthe city as a destination for luxury
OL,17,Fshopping that was dubbed "Knightsbridge
OL,18,Fof the North".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
