OL,3,GNEWSAHow Harvey Nichols shaped
OL,4,Anoughties Leeds shopping - and what
OL,5,Acomes next
OL,6,
OL,7,FIts cultural significance was such that
OL,8,Fit was regularly mentioned in the
OL,9,Fsitcom Absolutely Fabulous, and its
OL,10,Fopening on Briggate saw throngs of
OL,11,Fshoppers turn up dressed as characters
OL,12,FEdina and Patsy.
OL,14,FNow its golden era has come to an end
OL,15,Fand it is set for a rebrand after a
OL,16,Fbuy-out by Frasers Group, with rumours
OL,17,Fthat it will become the city's second
OL,18,Fbranch of designer goods store
OL,19,FFlannels.
